This software includes annotation, transaction, recovery and geometry code
extracted from the authors' earlier private coronary research annotation tool.
SOURCE_ORIGIN.json records the source-file hashes used for this extraction.
Legacy compatibility preserves the earlier ImageCAS-X schema identifiers and
original provenance when users explicitly import such data. The public product
does not require that dataset.

Application code is licensed under Apache License 2.0. Dependencies retain their
own licenses. Binary distributions include dependency inventories, license text,
and corresponding Qt/PySide source archives. No patient data is distributed.
